# License

INIAD Plus is a fork of `akahoshi1421/INIAD-`.

## Inherited project code

The upstream README states that the license is free, while some files such as
`js/download.js` and files under `lib/` carry MIT or other third-party
licenses. INIAD Plus keeps that upstream license statement for inherited code.

